    description: "Found by the 2026-10-31 docstring staleness audit (dev 5f6b2af921): a reviewer flagged it and a default-REJECT verifier re-reproduced it on a fixture of its own (reports under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/staleness_audit_10312026/review and verify). Corpus impact not measured. _LIB_CALL_RE_TEMPLATE = r'{var}\\.(\\w+)\\s*\\(' (lua_ffi.py:81). With local lib = ffi.load(\"mylib\") in scope, stdlib.compress(1) is scanned as compress. v11."  # c44b
